      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two processes and one loopback socket. The CLI is a third client of that socket,\nnot a second path into the data. The desktop app supervises the daemon; it never\nreads the database or spawns a runtime itself.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two processes and one loopback socket. The CLI is a third client of that socket,\nnot a second path into the data. The desktop app supervises the daemon; it never\nreads the database or spawns a runtime itself.",
